Modified 2026-10-18 for native J713 brightness-only transport: the generic
DRM, audio, property parser, service-call, trace and debug scratch paths were
removed. Ring metadata spacing and entry alignment follow the firmware's
variable block size. Native envelopes use byte transaction tags. Incoming
entries are consumed before releasing their slots, and timed-out command DMA
remains owned by the transport until an acknowledgement or reboot.

client.c, native-wire.h and Kbuild are GPL-2.0-only. The combined kernel module
